    <string name="share_text">Cortex Translate — instant on-screen translation, fully offline after you download a language pack.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body">1. Grant overlay permission.\n2. Download English and your target language.\n3. Tap the power button to start the floating C bubble.\n4. Open any app and tap the bubble to translate. Long-press opens options. Drag the bubble down to the red button to close it.</string>
